WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.540
Requests still start as an email, an attachment, a spreadsheet.

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.580
Here, one front door.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.580
Pick the kind.

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.060
The form adapts.

5
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:13.380
Drop the vendor's draft, a managed IT services agreement.

6
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:19.820
legalVector fills only the empty fields: title, counterparty, contract type, and what

7
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.020
Legal should know.

8
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.580
Each field says it came from the document.

9
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.020
Undo if you want.

10
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.660
One click sends it.

11
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:32.220
It is now a Legal Request in Doxis: descriptors, file, and a number.
